1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,742
Why the fuck is the ocean

2
00:00:01,762 --> 00:00:03,613
blue if water is clear?

3
00:00:03,818 --> 00:00:05,466
It's not reflecting the sky.

4
00:00:05,663 --> 00:00:07,236
Water itself is a little bit

5
00:00:07,256 --> 00:00:09,371
blue. Here's how it works.

6
00:00:09,579 --> 00:00:12,289
Sunlight is every color mixed together:

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,607
red, orange,

8
00:00:13,627 --> 00:00:14,512
yellow, green,

9
00:00:14,532 --> 00:00:15,702
blue. Step one:

10
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:16,972
water eats red.

11
00:00:17,115 --> 00:00:18,722
Water molecules absorb red light first.

12
00:00:19,065 --> 00:00:21,855
Sam dives with red fins.

13
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,182
At just 5 meters,

14
00:00:24,463 --> 00:00:26,461
about 90% of the red is

15
00:00:26,481 --> 00:00:28,224
gone. His fins look brown.

16
00:00:28,469 --> 00:00:29,987
Step two:

17
00:00:30,381 --> 00:00:31,315
the rest fades.

18
00:00:31,524 --> 00:00:32,073
Go deeper,

19
00:00:32,094 --> 00:00:33,015
and orange,

20
00:00:33,338 --> 00:00:35,921
yellow, then green get swallowed too.

21
00:00:35,942 --> 00:00:36,577
Step three:

22
00:00:36,597 --> 00:00:37,716
blue survives.

23
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:39,080
Blue travels the farthest,

24
00:00:39,374 --> 00:00:40,791
bounces around,

25
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,375
and comes back up to your

26
00:00:42,396 --> 00:00:45,465
eye. There's just one exception.

27
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:47,496
Near the coast,

28
00:00:47,796 --> 00:00:48,339
plankton and mud turn water green

29
00:00:48,359 --> 00:00:48,778
or brown.

30
00:00:48,798 --> 00:00:51,896
Below 200 meters,

31
00:00:52,213 --> 00:00:53,701
hardly any light.

32
00:00:53,722 --> 00:00:55,093
Below 1,000,

33
00:00:55,344 --> 00:00:56,608
total darkness.

34
00:00:56,774 --> 00:00:57,314
A glass of water is about

35
00:00:57,334 --> 00:00:58,067
10 cm deep.

36
00:00:58,454 --> 00:01:05,346
The ocean averages about 3,700 meters.

37
00:01:05,655 --> 00:01:07,265
Water isn't clear.

38
00:01:07,496 --> 00:01:08,734
There's just not enough of it

39
00:01:08,754 --> 00:01:09,832
in your glass to see the

40
00:01:09,852 --> 00:01:12,380
blue. Follow for more why the

41
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,549
fuck science.

